<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech Dec PPI unchanged mo/mo, +4.4 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Czech Dec PPI unchanged mo/mo, +4.4 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-01-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Czech real industrial producer prices were unchanged in December, putting prices 4.4 percent higher than in the same month in 1995, the Czech Statistical Bureau (CSU) said on Tuesday.</p>
<p> CZECH PRODUCER PRICES    DEC 1996    NOV 1996    DEC 1995</p>
<p>Industrial</p>
<p>  pct change month/month   +0.0	  +0.3	   -0.2</p>
<p>  pct change year/year     +4.4	  +4.2	   +7.2</p>
<p>Construction prices</p>
<p>  pct change month/month   +0.6	  +0.6	   +0.1</p>
<p>  pct change year/year    +11.2	 +10.7	  +12.3</p>
<p>Agricultural prices</p>
<p>  pct change month/month    n/a	   n/a	    n/a</p>
<p>  pct change year/year     +6.8	  +9.0	   +6.1</p>
<p>-- Prague Newsroom, 42-2-2423-0003</p>
</text>
